"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Fourth quarter\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [What's New @ IBM Quantum Q4 2025](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/whats-new-q4-2025) quarterly update is now live!\n"
msgstr "Live na ngayon ang quarterly update na [What's New @ IBM Quantum Q4 2025](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/whats-new-q4-2025)!\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This convenient wrap-up aims to get you started exploring the latest hardware, software, research, and community events from IBM Quantum and our partner ecosystem.\n"
msgstr "Layunin ng maginhawang buod na ito na tulungan kang magsimula sa pagtuklas ng pinakabagong hardware, software, pananaliksik, at mga community event mula sa IBM Quantum at aming partner ecosystem.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Highlights include the recently deployed IBM Quantum Nighthawk and IBM Quantum Heron r3 QPUs, a call for submissions to the new open-source Quantum Advantage Tracker, and Qiskit C++, a new project designed to help HPC developers build production-grade quantum-centric supercomputing workflows.\n"
msgstr "Kasama sa mga highlight ang kamakailang na-deploy na IBM Quantum Nighthawk at IBM Quantum Heron r3 QPUs, isang panawagan para sa mga submission sa bagong open-source na Quantum Advantage Tracker, at Qiskit C++, isang bagong proyekto na dinisenyo upang tulungan ang mga HPC developer na bumuo ng production-grade na quantum-centric supercomputing workflows.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This quarterly update also spotlights notable benchmarks, including:\n"
msgstr "Itinatampok din ng quarterly update na ito ang mga kapansin-pansing benchmark, kabilang ang:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Best EPLG: 0.23% on `ibm_boston` (IBM&reg; Heron r3)\n"
msgstr "Best EPLG: 0.23% sa `ibm_boston` (IBM&reg; Heron r3)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Best CLOPS: 330K+ across 7 QPUs\n"
msgstr "Best CLOPS: 330K+ sa 7 QPUs\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Total available qubits: 2,477 across 17 QPUs\n"
msgstr "Total available qubits: 2,477 sa 17 QPUs\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Total papers using IBM Quantum or Qiskit: 5,635\n"
msgstr "Total papers using IBM Quantum or Qiskit: 5,635\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Discover these updates and more](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/whats-new-q4-2025).\n"
msgstr "[Tuklasin ang mga update na ito at higit pa](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/whats-new-q4-2025).\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compute resources page update – Unified QPU view across regions {#compute-resources-page-update-unified-qpu-view-across-regions}"
msgstr "Update sa Compute resources page – Unified na QPU view sa lahat ng rehiyon {#compute-resources-page-update-unified-qpu-view-across-regions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We’ve enhanced the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page! New features include the following:\n"
msgstr "Pinahusay namin ang [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page! Kasama sa mga bagong feature ang mga sumusunod:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Unified QPU view** - All QPUs across regions are now displayed in a single table, making it easier to see status and calibrations of the shared fleet across the two regions.\n"
msgstr "**Unified QPU view** - Lahat ng QPU sa lahat ng rehiyon ay ipinapakita na ngayon sa iisang table, para mas madaling makita ang status at calibrations ng shared fleet sa dalawang rehiyon.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Clearer \"Instance Access\" Details** - When viewing a QPU's details, a new Instance access section shows all instances that grant you access to that QPU for the selected account.\n"
msgstr "**Mas Malinaw na \"Instance Access\" Details** - Kapag tinitingnan ang details ng isang QPU, ipinapakita ng bagong Instance access section ang lahat ng instance na nagbibigay sa iyo ng access sa QPU na iyon para sa napiling account.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can still filter the Compute resources table by region using the funnel icon at the top of the table.\n"
msgstr "Puwede mo pa ring i-filter ang Compute resources table ayon sa rehiyon gamit ang funnel icon sa itaas ng table.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "3 November 2025 {#3-november-2025}"
msgstr "3 Nobyembre 2025 {#3-november-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The quantum computer `ibm_brisbane` has been retired and will no longer accept workload submissions. Any workloads that were already queued on these QPUs might still be processed and return results.\n"
msgstr "Ang quantum computer na `ibm_brisbane` ay retirado na at hindi na tatanggap ng mga workload submission. Ang anumang workload na nasa queue na sa mga QPU na ito ay maaaring maproseso pa rin at magbigay ng resulta.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you would like to retrieve job data from important workloads run on this QPU, refer to [these instructions](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu).\n"
msgstr "Kung gusto mong kunin ang job data mula sa mahahalagang workload na pinatakbo sa QPU na ito, sumangguni sa [mga tagubiling ito](/guides/retired-qpus#retrieve-a-job-from-a-retired-qpu).\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "October 2025 {#october-2025}"
msgstr "Oktubre 2025 {#october-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The IBM Quantum fleet welcomes `ibm_fez` and `ibm_marrakesh` to the Open Plan! All users can access these computers as of 27 October.\n"
msgstr "Tinatanggap na ng IBM Quantum fleet ang `ibm_fez` at `ibm_marrakesh` sa Open Plan! Ma-access na ng lahat ng user ang mga computer na ito simula 27 Oktubre.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A reminder that `ibm_brisbane` will retire on 3 Nov 2025, so plan your experiments accordingly.\n"
msgstr "Paalala na magreretiro ang `ibm_brisbane` sa 3 Nob 2025, kaya planuhin ang iyong mga eksperimento ayon dito.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Learn quantum computing in your own language**: We're excited to announce that translations are now available across all documentation and learning pages on IBM Quantum Platform! Translations have been the most-requested feature in user feedback, and now, quantum learning and development are more accessible than ever.\n"
msgstr "**Matutong mag-quantum computing sa sarili mong wika**: Kami ay excited na ianunsyo na available na ngayon ang mga translation sa lahat ng documentation at learning pages sa IBM Quantum Platform! Ang mga translation ang pinakahinihinging feature sa user feedback, at ngayon, mas accessible na kailanman ang quantum learning at development.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Translations of **tutorials, courses, documentation, and announcements** are now available in seven languages: French, German, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese, and Spanish.\n"
msgstr "Available na ang mga translation ng **tutorials, courses, documentation, at announcements** sa pitong wika: French, German, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese, at Spanish.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Multilingual search**: Use the search bar to find what you need in your preferred language.\n"
msgstr "**Multilingual search**: Gamitin ang search bar para mahanap ang kailangan mo sa gusto mong wika.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Downloadable resources**: Download resources such as guides or tutorials in the language that suits you best.\n"
msgstr "**Madadownload na resources**: I-download ang mga resources tulad ng gabay o tutorial sa wikang pinakaangkop sa iyo.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Localized API references**: Explore the latest version of the API reference and REST APIs with fully translated documentation (current versions only).\n"
msgstr "**Localized na API references**: Tuklasin ang pinakabagong bersyon ng API reference at REST APIs na may ganap na isinaling documentation (kasalukuyang bersyon lamang).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Error messages & solutions**: Understand issues faster with translated error codes and suggested solutions.\n"
msgstr "**Mga error message at solusyon**: Mas mabilis na maunawaan ang mga isyu gamit ang isinaling error codes at mga mungkahing solusyon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Find a translation error? Let us know! [Submit a translation issue](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation/issues/new?template=translations.yaml) in our GitHub repo.\n"
msgstr "  May nakita kang error sa translation? Sabihin sa amin! [Magsumite ng translation issue](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation/issues/new?template=translations.yaml) sa aming GitHub repo.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  *Note that there is a processing delay between the publication of new content and its translation, so you might only see the English version of recently released content for a few days while the translation is underway.*\n"
msgstr "  *Tandaan na may pagkaantala sa pagproseso sa pagitan ng paglathala ng bagong content at ng translation nito, kaya maaari mo lamang makita ang English na bersyon ng kamakailang inilabas na content sa loob ng ilang araw habang isinasagawa ang translation.*\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Learning in IBM Quantum Platform** now has an updated home page to help you navigate the educational resources available, as well as two new catalog pages to help browse courses and modules. [Check out the updates!](/learning)\n"
msgstr "**Ang Learning sa IBM Quantum Platform** ay mayroon na ngayong na-update na home page para tulungan kang mag-navigate sa mga available na educational resources, pati na rin ang dalawang bagong catalog page para makatulong mag-browse ng mga course at module. [Tingnan ang mga update!](/learning)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<span id=\"new-dynamic-circuits\"></span>\n"
"- The new dynamic circuits is now available to all users on all backends, except some QPUs under the On-Prem Plan.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  With this new version, you can run dynamic circuits at utility scale. The initial release offers the following features:\n"
msgstr "  Sa bagong bersyong ito, puwede kang magpatakbo ng dynamic circuits sa utility scale. Nag-aalok ang unang release ng mga sumusunod na feature:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "75x execution speedup, thanks to the latest quantum execution stack\n"
msgstr "75x na mas mabilis na execution, salamat sa pinakabagong quantum execution stack\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Parallel branch execution, which reduces circuit duration and improves result quality\n"
msgstr "Parallel branch execution, na nagpapababa sa tagal ng circuit at nagpapahusay sa kalidad ng resulta\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support for [classical operations](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit_classical) defined in Qiskit, with the exception of bit shift and arithmetic\n"
msgstr "Suporta para sa [classical operations](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit_classical) na naka-define sa Qiskit, maliban sa bit shift at arithmetic\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support for stretch duration in delay instructions. This new type allows design intent to be captured at circuit construction time, and timing resolution at compile time\n"
msgstr "Suporta para sa stretch duration sa delay instructions. Ang bagong type na ito ay nagbibigay-daan na makuha ang design intent sa oras ng circuit construction, at timing resolution sa oras ng compile\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Additional features will be rolled out later this year.\n"
msgstr "  Ilalabas ang karagdagang mga feature sa susunod na bahagi ng taon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  See  [Classical feedforward and control flow](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow) and [Deferred timing resolution using stretch](/guides/stretch) for more information and code examples.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Third Quarter\">\n"
msgstr ""
"  Tingnan ang [Classical feedforward and control flow](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow) at [Deferred timing resolution using stretch](/guides/stretch) para sa karagdagang impormasyon at mga halimbawa ng code.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Third Quarter\">\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "15 September 2025 {#15-september-2025}"
msgstr "15 Setyembre 2025 {#15-september-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [Unitary Foundation Quantum Open Source Software survey](http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25) helps capture the needs and concerns of anyone who works with quantum software - including you! The survey results provide valuable feedback for our team of Qiskit developers, and helps us to understand the broader quantum software landscape.\n"
msgstr "Ang [Unitary Foundation Quantum Open Source Software survey](http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25) ay tumutulong na makuha ang mga pangangailangan at alalahanin ng sinumang gumagawa gamit ang quantum software - kasama ka na rito! Ang mga resulta ng survey ay nagbibigay ng mahalagang feedback para sa aming team ng mga Qiskit developer, at tumutulong sa aming maunawaan ang mas malawak na quantum software landscape.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have a few minutes, please share the link or consider filling it out today! The survey is open through 3 October 2025.\n"
msgstr "Kung mayroon kang ilang minuto, mangyaring ibahagi ang link o isaalang-alang na sagutan ito ngayon! Bukas ang survey hanggang 3 Oktubre 2025.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25](http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25)\n"
msgstr "[http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25](http://surveymonkey.com/r/QOSSSurvey25)\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "1 September 2025 {#1-september-2025}"
msgstr "1 Setyembre 2025 {#1-september-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We plan to retire `ibm_brisbane` on or around 1 November 2025.\n"
msgstr "Plano naming iretiro ang `ibm_brisbane` sa o malapit sa 1 Nobyembre 2025.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once this QPU is retired, it will no longer accept jobs. If any jobs are queued on the QPU at the time of its retirement, they will still run and return results. Please plan your experiments accordingly.\n"
msgstr "Kapag naretiro na ang QPU na ito, hindi na ito tatanggap ng mga job. Kung may mga job na naka-queue sa QPU sa oras ng pagretiro nito, tatakbo pa rin ang mga ito at magbibigay ng resulta. Mangyaring planuhin ang iyong mga eksperimento ayon dito.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "31 July 2025 {#31-july-2025}"
msgstr "31 Hulyo 2025 {#31-july-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Today, we are thrilled to announce the launch of ibm_pittsburgh, our first quantum computer powered by the new Heron Revision 3 (r3) QPU, and located in our Poughkeepsie quantum datacenter. r3 is the result of targeted improvements that directly impact coherence, gate fidelity, and readout performance.\n"
msgstr "Ngayon, ikinararangal naming ianunsyo ang paglulunsad ng ibm_pittsburgh, ang aming unang quantum computer na pinapatakbo ng bagong Heron Revision 3 (r3) QPU, at matatagpuan sa aming Poughkeepsie quantum datacenter. Ang r3 ay resulta ng mga naka-target na pagpapabuti na direktang nakaaapekto sa coherence, gate fidelity, at readout performance.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The results speak for themselves, including an industry-leading ~350 us of T2 coherence; see the [latest metrics on Pittsburgh](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_pittsburgh) on IBM Quantum Platform. This steady, measured progress is at the center of our strategy for delivering reliable and performant quantum computing.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga resulta ay nagsasalita para sa sarili nila, kasama ang isang industry-leading na ~350 us na T2 coherence; tingnan ang [pinakabagong metrics sa Pittsburgh](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_pittsburgh) sa IBM Quantum Platform. Ang matatag at maingat na progresong ito ang nasa gitna ng aming estratehiya para sa paghahatid ng maaasahan at mahusay na quantum computing.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As recently announced, today we retire one of our Eagle processors, ibm_sherbrooke. We invite you to migrate to our quantum computers powered by Heron processors, to take advantage of the lower error rates (approximately 5x lower EPLG) and faster gates (nearly 8x faster), leading to more performant circuits.\n"
msgstr "Tulad ng kamakailang inanunsyo, ngayon inireretiro namin ang isa sa aming mga Eagle processor, ang ibm_sherbrooke. Inaanyayahan ka naming lumipat sa aming mga quantum computer na pinapatakbo ng mga Heron processor, para masulit ang mas mababang error rates (humigit-kumulang 5x mas mababang EPLG) at mas mabilis na gates (halos 8x mas mabilis), na nagreresulta sa mas mahusay na circuits.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Together, let’s open the door to more complex algorithmic exploration and real-world applications.\n"
msgstr "Magkasama, buksan natin ang pinto tungo sa mas kumplikadong algorithmic exploration at real-world applications.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "24 July 2025 {#24-july-2025}"
msgstr "24 Hulyo 2025 {#24-july-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum technology is advancing rapidly, and it can be challenging to keep up. To help you stay in the loop, we’ve put together a roundup featuring the newest tools, performance improvements, and updates from IBM Quantum. It includes links to code examples, documentation, and research to help you get the most out of our latest developments.\n"
msgstr "Mabilis na umuunlad ang quantum technology, at maaaring mahirap na makasabay dito. Para matulungan kang manatiling updated, naghanda kami ng roundup na kinapapalooban ng pinakabagong tools, performance improvements, at updates mula sa IBM Quantum. Kasama rito ang mga link sa mga code example, documentation, at research para matulungan kang masulit ang aming pinakabagong mga development.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Learn what's new at IBM Quantum](https://ibm.biz/whats-new-at-ibm-quantum-h1-2025-op)\n"
msgstr "[Alamin ang bago sa IBM Quantum](https://ibm.biz/whats-new-at-ibm-quantum-h1-2025-op)\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "27 June 2025 {#27-june-2025}"
msgstr "27 Hunyo 2025 {#27-june-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`ibm_sherbrooke` will now retire on or around 28 July 2025.\n"
msgstr "Magreretiro na ngayon ang `ibm_sherbrooke` sa o malapit sa 28 Hulyo 2025.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Be sure to retrieve any job data from important past jobs before it is retired.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Second quarter\">\n"
msgstr ""
"Siguraduhing kunin ang anumang job data mula sa mahahalagang nakaraang job bago ito maretiro.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Second quarter\">\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "24 June 2025 {#24-june-2025}"
msgstr "24 Hunyo 2025 {#24-june-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Profile page: Now you can find integrated profile details directly in the new platform. Find your profile by clicking on the user icon in the top right or visiting your [profile page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/profile).\n"
msgstr "Profile page: Puwede mo nang mahanap ang integrated na profile details direkta sa bagong platform. Hanapin ang iyong profile sa pag-click sa user icon sa kanang bahagi sa itaas o sa pagbisita sa iyong [profile page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/profile).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Public backends: View a list of US backends without logging in, available on the updated [Compute Resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page.\n"
msgstr "Public backends: Tingnan ang listahan ng US backends nang hindi mag-log in, available sa na-update na [Compute Resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learning: Quantum computing courses have now been released in the upgraded platform, along with new educational modules designed to help teachers bring Qiskit into their classrooms. This is the first step towards migrating IBM Quantum Learning to the new platform, with more resources to be released in the coming weeks. Resources can be accessed without needing to log in at [IBM Quantum Learning](/learning). Check out new and updated content, including [Quantum diagonalization algorithms](/learning/courses/quantum-diagonalization-algorithms), [Quantum computing in practice](/learning/courses/quantum-computing-in-practice), and Qiskit in Classrooms modules like [Quantum mechanics](/learning/modules/quantum-mechanics) and [Computer science](/learning/modules/computer-science).\n"
msgstr "Learning: Inilabas na ngayon ang mga quantum computing course sa na-upgrade na platform, kasama ang mga bagong educational module na idinisenyo para tulungan ang mga guro na dalhin ang Qiskit sa kanilang mga classroom. Ito ang unang hakbang tungo sa paglipat ng IBM Quantum Learning sa bagong platform, na may karagdagang resources na ilalabas sa mga susunod na linggo. Ma-access ang mga resources nang hindi kailangang mag-log in sa [IBM Quantum Learning](/learning). Tingnan ang bago at na-update na content, kasama ang [Quantum diagonalization algorithms](/learning/courses/quantum-diagonalization-algorithms), [Quantum computing in practice](/learning/courses/quantum-computing-in-practice), at mga Qiskit in Classrooms modules tulad ng [Quantum mechanics](/learning/modules/quantum-mechanics) at [Computer science](/learning/modules/computer-science).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Composer: The circuit-building [Composer](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/composer) has now been migrated to the new platform. The experience is largely the same, except for files will no longer be stored in the platform, and will need to be downloaded locally. Find more details in the [Composer documentation](/guides/composer).\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum Composer: Ang circuit-building na [Composer](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/composer) ay nailipat na ngayon sa bagong platform. Halos pareho pa rin ang karanasan, maliban sa hindi na ma-i-store ang mga file sa platform, at kailangan nang i-download nang lokal. Hanapin ang karagdagang detalye sa [Composer documentation](/guides/composer).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Announcements: Now you can access news, software updates, and service alerts on the new platform. Click the bell icon in the top navigation bar or the link under Featured resources on the [home page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) to visit the new Announcements page.\n"
msgstr "Announcements: Puwede ka na ngayong mag-access ng balita, software updates, at service alerts sa bagong platform. I-click ang bell icon sa itaas na navigation bar o ang link sa ilalim ng Featured resources sa [home page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) para bisitahin ang bagong Announcements page.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "5 June 2025 {#5-june-2025}"
msgstr "5 Hunyo 2025 {#5-june-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Added instance job filter: The platform now displays only your workloads by default. On the dashboard, you will see only the latest workloads you have submitted to instances within your account.\n"
msgstr "Nagdagdag ng instance job filter: Ipinapakita na ngayon ng platform ang iyo lamang na mga workload bilang default. Sa dashboard, makikita mo lamang ang pinakabagong mga workload na isinumite mo sa mga instance sa loob ng iyong account.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Only the latest workloads now shown by default](/docs/images/guides/latest-updates/workloads.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Only the latest workloads now shown by default](/docs/images/guides/latest-updates/workloads.avif)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A new qiskit-ibm-runtime release, featuring:\n"
msgstr "Bagong release ng qiskit-ibm-runtime, na may:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support for private jobs for developers of Qiskit Functions\n"
msgstr "Suporta para sa private jobs para sa mga developer ng Qiskit Functions\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A new channel for the platform that makes instance selection optional, which simplifies account setup and backend access by automatically checking all available instances. This update benefits users who manage multiple instances or prefer a streamlined workflow without specifying instance details each time. Developers and researchers working across various projects with different levels of access and multiple backends will find this especially helpful.\n"
msgstr "Isang bagong channel para sa platform na ginagawang optional ang instance selection, na nagpapasimple sa account setup at backend access sa pamamagitan ng awtomatikong pagche-check sa lahat ng available na instance. Ang update na ito ay nakikinabang sa mga user na namamahala ng maraming instance o mas gusto ang isang streamlined workflow nang hindi kailangang tukuyin ang instance details tuwing gagamitin. Makikinabang lalo dito ang mga developer at researcher na gumagawa sa iba't ibang proyekto na may iba't ibang antas ng access at maraming backend.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now available: Early access to the new version of dynamic circuits on select QPUs. This new version will allow you to run dynamic circuits at utility scale and comes with improvements in speed, quality, and usability. Premium Plan and Flex Plan users interested in participating in this early access can [contact us](/guides/support).\n"
msgstr "Available na ngayon: Early access sa bagong bersyon ng dynamic circuits sa piling QPU. Ang bagong bersyong ito ay magbibigay-daan sa iyong magpatakbo ng dynamic circuits sa utility scale at may kasamang mga pagpapabuti sa bilis, kalidad, at usability. Ang mga user ng Premium Plan at Flex Plan na interesadong sumali sa early access na ito ay maaaring [makipag-ugnayan sa amin](/guides/support).\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "15 May 2025 {#15-may-2025}"
msgstr "15 Mayo 2025 {#15-may-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Note: This is relevant to IBM Quantum Platform Classic (at https://quantum.ibm.com/) only.*\n"
msgstr "*Tandaan: Ito ay may kinalaman lamang sa IBM Quantum Platform Classic (sa https://quantum.ibm.com/).*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are still using [IBM Quantum Platform Classic](https://quantum.ibm.com/) at https://quantum.ibm.com, please note that it will no longer be accessible starting 1 July 2025. At that time, Open Plan access will only be available on the [new Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), and you will no longer have access to this platform or its data. Download your data and migrate to the new platform as soon as possible to avoid interruptions in your work. See the migration guide for more details.\n"
msgstr "Kung gumagamit ka pa rin ng [IBM Quantum Platform Classic](https://quantum.ibm.com/) sa https://quantum.ibm.com, tandaan na hindi na ito ma-a-access simula 1 Hulyo 2025. Sa oras na iyon, ang Open Plan access ay available na lamang sa [bagong Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), at hindi mo na magiging accessible ang platform na ito o ang datos nito. I-download ang iyong datos at lumipat sa bagong platform sa lalong madaling panahon para maiwasan ang mga interruption sa iyong trabaho. Tingnan ang migration guide para sa karagdagang detalye.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users of other plans (for example, Premium Plan or On-Prem Plan) should wait for specific instructions from their administrators before migrating.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga user ng ibang plano (halimbawa, Premium Plan o On-Prem Plan) ay dapat maghintay ng partikular na tagubilin mula sa kanilang mga administrator bago lumipat.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "8 May 2025 {#8-may-2025}"
msgstr "8 Mayo 2025 {#8-may-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Flex Plan](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/flex-plan), a new resource consumption offering, has been released.\n"
msgstr "Inilabas na ang [Flex Plan](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/flex-plan), isang bagong resource consumption offering.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Tutorials](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials) are now available on the platform to help users with use-case exploration.\n"
msgstr "Available na ngayon sa platform ang mga [Tutorial](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials) para tulungan ang mga user sa use-case exploration.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [Qiskit Functions Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions) has launched on the platform.\n"
msgstr "Nailunsad na ang [Qiskit Functions Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions) sa platform.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Updated Session OpenAPI schema: `backend_name` field is now nullable.\n"
msgstr "Na-update na Session OpenAPI schema: Nullable na ngayon ang field na `backend_name`.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "24 April 2025 {#24-april-2025}"
msgstr "24 Abril 2025 {#24-april-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instance limits: Individuals can view [available time and usage](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), which displays alerts when approaching limits.\n"
msgstr "Instance limits: Makikita ng mga indibidwal ang [available na oras at paggamit](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), na nagpapakita ng mga alerto kapag malapit na sa limitasyon.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Administrator permissions: Administrators can view overall usage, cycle period, and remaining time per plan in the Instances page.\n"
msgstr "Administrator permissions: Makikita ng mga administrator ang kabuuang paggamit, cycle period, at natitirang oras kada plano sa Instances page.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Search: Search is now integrated and available for filtering documentation content, including guides and API references.\n"
msgstr "Search: Naka-integrate at available na ngayon ang search para sa pag-filter ng documentation content, kasama ang mga gabay at API references.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Billing: Pay-As-You-Go users can find a link to billing by clicking the overflow menu for each instance on the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page.\n"
msgstr "Billing: Makikita ng mga user ng Pay-As-You-Go ang link sa billing sa pag-click sa overflow menu para sa bawat instance sa [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "New sign-in option: Sign-in with Google is now available on the [sign-in page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/signin).\n"
msgstr "Bagong sign-in option: Available na ngayon ang Sign-in gamit ang Google sa [sign-in page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/signin).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bug fixes:\n"
msgstr "Mga bug fix:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Addressed failed batch sessions for Open Plan users.\n"
msgstr "Naayos ang mga failed batch sessions para sa mga user ng Open Plan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Addressed batch sessions not closing properly.\n"
msgstr "Naayos ang isyu kung saan hindi maayos na nagsasara ang mga batch sessions.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Improved platform stability by improving error handling and better recovery.\n"
msgstr "Pinahusay ang stability ng platform sa pamamagitan ng pagpapabuti ng error handling at mas magandang recovery.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Addressed an issue that prevented QPU metrics to be displayed for the QPUs in the eu-de region.\n"
msgstr "Naayos ang isyung nagpapabalewala sa QPU metrics na hindi maipakita para sa mga QPU sa eu-de region.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deprecation reminder: The deprecation date for IBM Quantum Platform Classic has been set for 1 July 2025.\n"
msgstr "Paalala tungkol sa deprecation: Naitakda na ang deprecation date para sa IBM Quantum Platform Classic sa 1 Hulyo 2025.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "21 April 2025 {#21-april-2025}"
msgstr "21 Abril 2025 {#21-april-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`ibm_kyiv` has been retired and will no longer accept workload submissions. Any workloads that were already queued on these QPUs might still be processed and return results.\n"
msgstr "Ang `ibm_kyiv` ay retirado na at hindi na tatanggap ng mga workload submission. Ang anumang workload na nasa queue na sa mga QPU na ito ay maaaring maproseso pa rin at magbigay ng resulta.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "10 April 2025 {#10-april-2025}"
msgstr "10 Abril 2025 {#10-april-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Updated navigation to remove duplicated pages:\n"
msgstr "Na-update ang navigation para alisin ang mga duplicate na page:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Administration section has been renamed \"Access management\" and now only focuses on managing users and access groups.\n"
msgstr "Ang Administration section ay pinalitan ng pangalang \"Access management\" at ngayon ay nakatuon na lamang sa pamamahala ng mga user at access groups.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "There is only one page each for managing instances and workloads; there are no longer separate pages for each in the Administration section.  Instead, what you can view and manage on each page is dependent on your access and permissions.\n"
msgstr "Iisang page na lamang ang mayroon para sa pamamahala ng mga instance at workload; wala nang hiwalay na page para sa bawat isa sa Administration section. Sa halip, ang iyong makikita at mapapamahalaan sa bawat page ay depende sa iyong access at permissions.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The analytics page (visible only to those with certain access) has been moved into the main navigation menu, to make it easier to find.\n"
msgstr "Ang analytics page (nakikita lamang ng mga may partikular na access) ay inilipat sa main navigation menu, para mas madaling mahanap.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Launched two new QPUs: ibm_aachen (eu-de region) and ibm_kingston (us-east region)\n"
msgstr "Naglunsad ng dalawang bagong QPU: ibm_aachen (eu-de region) at ibm_kingston (us-east region)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Individuals who can view the analytics page can now filter the data to view information per plan.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga indibidwal na makakakita ng analytics page ay puwede na ngayong mag-filter ng datos para makita ang impormasyon kada plano.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Administrators can now more easily add multiple individuals to an access group due to the addition of an existing account members table.\n"
msgstr "Mas madali na ngayong makapagdagdag ang mga administrator ng maraming indibidwal sa isang access group dahil sa pagdaragdag ng table ng mga umiiral nang account member.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Premium plan instance administrators can set the instance allocation as a usage limit, so that usage in those instances cannot exceed the time alloted. See the [Set instance allocation limits](/guides/allocation-limits) guide for instructions.\n"
msgstr "Puwede nang itakda ng mga administrator ng instance ng Premium plan ang instance allocation bilang usage limit, para hindi mahigitan ng paggamit sa mga instance na iyon ang oras na inilaan. Tingnan ang [Set instance allocation limits](/guides/allocation-limits) na gabay para sa mga tagubilin.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note that the sunset date for IBM Quantum Platform Classic has been set for 1 July 2025.\n"
msgstr "Tandaan na naitakda na ang sunset date para sa IBM Quantum Platform Classic sa 1 Hulyo 2025.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "9 April 2025 {#9-april-2025}"
msgstr "9 Abril 2025 {#9-april-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two new 156Q Heron R2 QPUs, [ibm_aachen](https://quantum.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen), located in the EU region, and [ibm_kingston](https://quantum.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_kingston), located in the US region, are now available.\n"
msgstr "Dalawang bagong 156Q Heron R2 QPU, ang [ibm_aachen](https://quantum.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_aachen), na matatagpuan sa EU region, at ang [ibm_kingston](https://quantum.ibm.com/computers?system=ibm_kingston), na matatagpuan sa US region, ay available na ngayon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"View the systems you have access to with your selected instance in the [Compute resources](https://quantum.ibm.com/services/resources) page on IBM Quantum Platform.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"First quarter\">\n"
msgstr ""
"Tingnan ang mga system na na-access mo gamit ang iyong napiling instance sa [Compute resources](https://quantum.ibm.com/services/resources) page sa IBM Quantum Platform.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"First quarter\">\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "27 March 2025 {#27-march-2025}"
msgstr "27 Marso 2025 {#27-march-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Cost limits for Pay-As-You-Go Plan** - Pay-As-You-Go Plan users with sufficient access can now view and edit [maximum cost limits](/guides/manage-cost#cost-limit) for their instances.\n"
msgstr "**Cost limits para sa Pay-As-You-Go Plan** - Ang mga user ng Pay-As-You-Go Plan na may sapat na access ay puwede na ngayong tingnan at i-edit ang [maximum cost limits](/guides/manage-cost#cost-limit) para sa kanilang mga instance.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Job management updates** - Now only administrators can delete workloads created by other users in an account, and collaborators will only be able to delete their own workloads.\n"
msgstr "**Mga update sa job management** - Ngayon, mga administrator lamang ang puwedeng magtanggal ng mga workload na ginawa ng ibang user sa isang account, at ang mga collaborator ay puwede na lamang magtanggal ng kanilang sariling mga workload.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Updated authentication error messages** - Error messaging has been improved for account and authentication processes to reduce issues with signup flow. The [Support page](/guides/support) has been expanded with recommendations for troubleshooting and resolving common errors.\n"
msgstr "**Na-update na mga error message sa authentication** - Napahusay ang error messaging para sa mga proseso ng account at authentication para mabawasan ang mga isyu sa signup flow. Pinalawak ang [Support page](/guides/support) ng mga rekomendasyon para sa troubleshooting at pag-resolba ng mga karaniwang error.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Increased default data retention** - The default data retention period for the new IBM Quantum Platform has been increased to three years, up from one year on IBM Quantum Platform Classic.\n"
msgstr "**Dinagdagan ang default data retention** - Ang default data retention period para sa bagong IBM Quantum Platform ay dinagdagan sa tatlong taon, mula sa isang taon sa IBM Quantum Platform Classic.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Resolved inconsistent behavior due to caching** - Some inconsistent behavior seen when updating instance limits, tags, and QPU resources has been resolved, which was due to caching.\n"
msgstr "**Naresolba ang hindi pare-parehong pag-uugali dahil sa caching** - Naresolba na ang ilang hindi pare-parehong pag-uugali na nakita kapag ina-update ang instance limits, tags, at QPU resources, na dulot ng caching.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "For full details on the early access release and upcoming improvements, [check out the blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/iqp-upgrade).\n"
msgstr "Para sa buong detalye ng early access release at mga darating na pagpapabuti, [tingnan ang blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/iqp-upgrade).\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "25 March 2025 {#25-march-2025}"
msgstr "25 Marso 2025 {#25-march-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "An IBM Quantum Network exclusive: Join us for our first quarterly IBM Quantum Product Updates Webinar, a series in which we unveil the latest advancements in our products and offerings, showcase partner use cases, and provide the opportunity for Q&A with quantum experts.\n"
msgstr "Isang eksklusibo para sa IBM Quantum Network: Sumali sa amin sa aming unang quarterly na IBM Quantum Product Updates Webinar, isang serye kung saan ibinubunyag namin ang pinakabagong mga pag-unlad sa aming mga produkto at alok, ipinapakita ang mga use case ng partner, at nagbibigay ng pagkakataon para sa Q&A kasama ang mga eksperto sa quantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the first segment, we will talk about the evolution coming to IBM Quantum Platform that is designed to enhance security, stability, and user experience. Our team will walk through the key updates, demonstrate new capabilities, and discuss how these improvements empower developers and users alike.\n"
msgstr "Sa unang bahagi, pag-uusapan namin ang ebolusyon na darating sa IBM Quantum Platform na idinisenyo para pahusayin ang seguridad, stability, at user experience. Dadaanan ng aming team ang mga pangunahing update, ipapakita ang mga bagong kakayahan, at pag-uusapan kung paano pinapalakas ng mga pagpapabuting ito ang parehong mga developer at user.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The second segment will feature the launch of three new and innovative Qiskit Functions in the Qiskit Functions Catalog. Each function provider will present their solution, highlighting its unique features, use cases, and impact on the broader ecosystem. Attendees will gain firsthand insights into how these Qiskit Functions can be leveraged for real-world applications.\n"
msgstr "Sa ikalawang bahagi, ipapakita ang paglulunsad ng tatlong bago at makabagong Qiskit Functions sa Qiskit Functions Catalog. Ipapakita ng bawat function provider ang kanilang solusyon, na binibigyang-diin ang natatanging mga feature nito, mga use case, at epekto sa mas malawak na ecosystem. Makakakuha ang mga dumalo ng mga first-hand na kaalaman kung paano magagamit ang mga Qiskit Functions na ito para sa mga real-world na aplikasyon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Learn more and register today](https://www.ibm.com/events/reg/flow/ibm/m1ok6zmb/landing/page/landing)\n"
msgstr "[Alamin pa at magrehistro ngayon](https://www.ibm.com/events/reg/flow/ibm/m1ok6zmb/landing/page/landing)\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "26 February 2025 {#26-february-2025}"
msgstr "26 Pebrero 2025 {#26-february-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Today, we are releasing an early access version of the upgraded experience, and invite you to [open an account and explore the new interface](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com). We will continue to roll out updates over the coming months, with the end goal of creating an experience that looks and feels like the classic version of IBM Quantum Platform, but with greater functionality. We will eventually sunset IBM Quantum Platform classic, so stay tuned for updates.\n"
msgstr "Ngayon, inilalabas namin ang isang early access na bersyon ng na-upgrade na karanasan, at inaanyayahan ka naming [magbukas ng account at tuklasin ang bagong interface](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com). Magpapatuloy kaming maglabas ng mga update sa mga susunod na buwan, na may end goal na lumikha ng karanasan na kahawig at kapareho ang dating ng classic na bersyon ng IBM Quantum Platform, pero may mas malaking functionality. Sa huli, ire-retire namin ang IBM Quantum Platform classic, kaya manatiling updated.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Please note: If your IBM Quantum Platform access falls under a plan administrator (Premium Plan, On-Prem Plan, Startup Program, etc.), you will receive guided migration support through your administrator in the coming months. In the meantime, you are welcome to [create a free Open Plan account to explore the new platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"
msgstr "Pakitandaan: Kung ang iyong access sa IBM Quantum Platform ay nasa ilalim ng isang plan administrator (Premium Plan, On-Prem Plan, Startup Program, atbp.), makakatanggap ka ng guided migration support mula sa iyong administrator sa mga susunod na buwan. Samantala, malugod kang tinatanggap na [gumawa ng libreng Open Plan account para tuklasin ang bagong platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "24 February 2025 {#24-february-2025}"
msgstr "24 Pebrero 2025 {#24-february-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Our inventory is getting a makeover, and we will be retiring the following QPUs on or around 18 April 2025:\n"
msgstr "Nagbabago ang aming inventory, at iretretiro namin ang mga sumusunod na QPU sa o malapit sa 18 Abril 2025:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "ibm_kyiv\n"
msgstr "ibm_kyiv\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "~ibm_sherbrooke~ UPDATE: ibm_sherbrooke will stay active for several more weeks after 18 April 2025.\n"
msgstr "~ibm_sherbrooke~ UPDATE: Mananatiling aktibo ang ibm_sherbrooke sa loob ng ilang linggo pa pagkatapos ng 18 Abril 2025.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Be sure to retrieve any job data from important past jobs before these QPUs are retired.\n"
msgstr "Siguraduhing kunin ang anumang job data mula sa mahahalagang nakaraang job bago maretiro ang mga QPU na ito.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "3 February 2025 {#3-february-2025}"
msgstr "3 Pebrero 2025 {#3-february-2025}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pulse-level control on all IBM Quantum processors has been removed.  Additionally, the pulse module is scheduled for removal in Qiskit SDK v2.0.  Instead, you can use fractional gates that are now built into the Instruction Set Architecture (ISA). For full details and help migrating your code, refer to [Migrate from Qiskit Pulse to fractional gates](/guides/pulse-migration).\n"
msgstr "Inalis na ang pulse-level control sa lahat ng IBM Quantum processor. Bukod pa rito, naka-iskedyul na alisin ang pulse module sa Qiskit SDK v2.0. Sa halip, puwede mong gamitin ang fractional gates na nakabuilt in na ngayon sa Instruction Set Architecture (ISA). Para sa buong detalye at tulong sa paglipat ng iyong code, sumangguni sa [Migrate from Qiskit Pulse to fractional gates](/guides/pulse-migration).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"new-version-dynamic-circuits\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "2 February 2025 {#2-february-2025}"
msgstr "2 Pebrero 2025 {#2-february-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- Starting 2 June 2025 and continuing through the year, IBM Quantum will begin a gradual rollout of new features to [dynamic circuits](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow) that will enable them at the utility scale.\n"
"Improvements include the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"- Simula 2 Hunyo 2025 at magpapatuloy sa buong taon, magsisimula ang IBM Quantum ng unti-unting paglabas ng mga bagong feature sa [dynamic circuits](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow) na magbibigay-daan sa mga ito sa utility scale.\n"
"Kasama sa mga pagpapabuti ang mga sumusunod:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A 75x speedup in execution by using the Gen3 engine stack\n"
msgstr "Isang 75x na pagbilis sa execution sa paggamit ng Gen3 engine stack\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Parallel execution of branches, which reduces circuit duration and improves result quality\n"
msgstr "Parallel execution ng mga branch, na nagpapababa sa tagal ng circuit at nagpapahusay sa kalidad ng resulta\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Improvement in mid-circuit measurement\n"
msgstr "Pagpapahusay sa mid-circuit measurement\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Better integration with dynamical decoupling\n"
msgstr "Mas magandang integrasyon sa dynamical decoupling\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "More visibility of circuit timing information\n"
msgstr "Mas maraming visibility ng circuit timing information\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "To accelerate the rollout, the following capabilities are now deprecated and will be no longer supported on or around 2 June 2025:\n"
msgstr "Upang mapabilis ang rollout, ang mga sumusunod na capability ay deprecated na at hindi na masusuportahan sa o pagkatapos ng 2 Hunyo 2025:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `while`, `for`, and `switch` control flow constructs\n"
msgstr "Ang `while`, `for`, at `switch` control flow constructs\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The ability to use control flow instructions inside the body of a branch (as in, nested control flow)\n"
msgstr "Ang kakayahang gumamit ng control flow instructions sa loob ng body ng isang branch (ibig sabihin, nested control flow)\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Conditional measurements\n"
msgstr "Conditional measurements\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "7 January 2025 {#7-january-2025}"
msgstr "7 Enero 2025 {#7-january-2025}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- The rollout of the Gen3 engine stack begins today. This engine stack gives a 75x speedup in execution.  The rollout will be done on one QPU at a time, where a percentage of the jobs on the QPU will use the Gen3 path.  You can also force the Gen3 path using the `gen3-turbo` experimental option. Note that this engine stack is not compatible with fractional gates, pulse gates, or dynamic circuits.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"- Nagsimula na ngayon ang rollout ng Gen3 engine stack. Ang engine stack na ito ay nagbibigay ng 75x na pagbilis sa execution. Isasagawa ang rollout sa isang QPU nang paisa-isa, kung saan ang isang porsyento ng mga job sa QPU ay gagamit ng Gen3 path. Maaari mo ring i-force ang Gen3 path gamit ang experimental option na `gen3-turbo`. Tandaan na ang engine stack na ito ay hindi compatible sa fractional gates, pulse gates, o dynamic circuits.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2024 {#2024}"
msgstr "2024 {#2024}"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "15 October 2024 {#15-october-2024}"
msgstr "15 Oktubre 2024 {#15-october-2024}"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support for `backend.run` has ended.\n"
msgstr "Natapos na ang suporta para sa `backend.run`.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "1 October 2024 {#1-october-2024}"
msgstr "1 Oktubre 2024 {#1-october-2024}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  - Parameterized delay gates have been deprecated.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Third quarter\">\n"
msgstr ""
"  - Ang mga parameterized delay gates ay deprecated na.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Ikatlong quarter\">\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "15 August 2024 {#15-august-2024}"
msgstr "15 Agosto 2024 {#15-august-2024}"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Probabilistic error amplification (PEA) error mitigation method is now available for Estimator V2. See the [`ZneOptions` API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-zne-options) for more details.\n"
msgstr "Ang Probabilistic error amplification (PEA) error mitigation method ay available na ngayon para sa Estimator V2. Tingnan ang [`ZneOptions` API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-zne-options) para sa mas maraming detalye.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A new helper program `noise-learner` is now available. It allows characterizing the noise processes affecting the gates in one or more circuits of interest, based on the Pauli-Lindblad noise model. The output noise model can then be passed to Estimator via the `layer_noise_model` option.\n"
msgstr "Ang isang bagong helper program na `noise-learner` ay available na ngayon. Pinapahintulutan nito ang pag-characterize ng mga noise process na nakakaapekto sa mga gate sa isa o higit pang mga circuit na kagustuhan, batay sa Pauli-Lindblad noise model. Ang resultang noise model ay maaari ng ipasa sa Estimator sa pamamagitan ng option na `layer_noise_model`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "V1 primitives are no longer supported.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga V1 primitives ay hindi na suportado.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "3 July 2024 {#3-july-2024}"
msgstr "3 Hulyo 2024 {#3-july-2024}"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following endpoints are deprecated and will be removed on or after 3 October 2024: `GET /stream/jobs` and `GET /stream/jobs/{id}`. This removal has the following impacts:\n"
msgstr "Ang mga sumusunod na endpoint ay deprecated na at aalisin sa o pagkatapos ng 3 Oktubre 2024: `GET /stream/jobs` at `GET /stream/jobs/{id}`. Ang pag-aalis na ito ay may mga sumusunod na epekto:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "After the endpoints are removed, `job.stream_results()` and `job.interim_results()` will be removed from the [qiskit-ibm-runtime](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime) client.\n"
msgstr "Pagkatapos maalis ang mga endpoint, ang `job.stream_results()` at `job.interim_results()` ay aalisin mula sa [qiskit-ibm-runtime](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime) client.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    - Additional methods, such as `job.result()` currently use the deprecated endpoints.  Upgrade to `qiskit_ibm_runtime` 0.25 or later before the endpoints are removed to avoid disruption.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Second quarter\">\n"
msgstr ""
"    - Ang mga karagdagang method, tulad ng `job.result()`, ay kasalukuyang gumagamit ng mga deprecated na endpoint. Mag-upgrade sa `qiskit_ibm_runtime` 0.25 o mas bago bago maalis ang mga endpoint upang maiwasan ang disruption.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Ikalawang quarter\">\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "18 June 2024 {#18-june-2024}"
msgstr "18 Hunyo 2024 {#18-june-2024}"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `optimization_level` option is deprecated for Estimator V2 and will be removed no sooner than 30 September 2024.\n"
msgstr "Ang option na `optimization_level` ay deprecated na para sa Estimator V2 at aalisin nang hindi mas maaga sa 30 Setyembre 2024.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "3 June 2024 {#3-june-2024}"
msgstr "3 Hunyo 2024 {#3-june-2024}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  - Probabilistic error amplification (PEA) error mitigation method is now available as an experimental option for Estimator V2. See the [`EstimatorOptions` API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-estimator-options) for more details.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"First quarter\">\n"
msgstr ""
"  - Ang Probabilistic error amplification (PEA) error mitigation method ay available na ngayon bilang experimental option para sa Estimator V2. Tingnan ang [`EstimatorOptions` API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-estimator-options) para sa mas maraming detalye.\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Unang quarter\">\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "28 March 2024 {#28-march-2024}"
msgstr "28 Marso 2024 {#28-march-2024}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  - Qiskit Runtime primitives now support OpenQASM 3 as the input format for circuits and standard JSON output format. See [Qiskit Runtime REST API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime) for examples.\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  </Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"  - Sinusuportahan na ngayon ng Qiskit Runtime primitives ang OpenQASM 3 bilang input format para sa mga circuit at standard JSON output format. Tingnan ang [Qiskit Runtime REST API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime) para sa mga halimbawa.\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  </Accordion>\n"
